{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-13T14:48:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T00:27:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T19:00:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121327.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-13T19:00:47Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nEnsures a consistent codestyle for aspects of the engine that we already attempt to enforce manually through dedicated codestyle reviews. Currently only applied to argument prefixes (`p_`, `r_`, or `rp_`) within \"core/\", both for ease of integration & to sample how involved such a change would be.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nRulesets were lifted from v19 of clang-tidy[^1], keeping with our system of staying 3 major versions behind the latest. I wanted this to be a foot-in-the-door PR, but there's already several other rulesets that we should strongly consider applying as well. An expanded, albeit non-exhaustive, example would be:\r\n```yaml\r\n  # PARAMETERS\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ParameterCase: lower_case\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ParameterPrefix: p_\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ParameterIgnoredRegexp: ^rp?_[^A-Z]* # Can't provide multiple prefixes; assume `r_` and `rp_` are already valid.\r\n\r\n  # CLASSES AND STRUCTS\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ClassCase: CamelCase\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ClassIgnoredRegexp: ^_.* # Some of our internal classes start with an underscore; should gradually phase out.\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ClassMemberCase: lower_case\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ClassMethodCase: lower_case\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ClassConstantCase: UPPER_CASE\r\n\r\n  # ENUMERATIONS\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.EnumCase: CamelCase\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.EnumConstantCase: UPPER_CASE\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.EnumConstantIgnoredRegexp: \"([A-Z0-9_]*[0-9]x[0-9][A-Z0-9_]*|_[A-Z0-9_]*)\" # Allow matrix notation (\"4x4\", \"8x8\", etc).\r\n\r\n  # MEMBERS\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.MemberCase: lower_case\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.MethodCase: lower_case\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.PrivateMemberPrefix: _\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.PrivateMethodPrefix: _\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ProtectedMemberPrefix: _\r\n  readability-identifier-naming.ProtectedMethodPrefix: _\r\n```\r\n[^1]: https://releases.llvm.org/19.1.0/tools/clang/tools/extra/docs/clang-tidy/checks/readability/identifier-naming.html","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121327/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121327/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":n